{
    "id":  3524,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "HARDNESS Concrete Pendant Lamp - Industrial style - E14",
    "reference":  "91110",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConcrete Pendant Lamp\u003c/strong\u003e that brings a retro touch to any space. Its \"\u003cstrong\u003emodern\u003c/strong\u003e\" design makes it perfect to combine with Filament LED bulbs from our website, as its structure allows to showcase the beauty of this type of unique bulbs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt adds personality and makes a difference in the \u003cstrong\u003edecoration of your spaces and trendy venues\u003c/strong\u003e with this family of pendant lamps.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e* Adjustable cable height\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003ePendant Lamp - Rectangular - DARK - Concrete\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eDARK pendant lamp\u003c/strong\u003e has a very simple design but with a very distinctive \u003cstrong\u003evintage-industrial style\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat makes this lamp different from others is that it is made of \u003cstrong\u003econcrete\u003c/strong\u003e, which gives it an interesting texture and a rustic feel. The colour of the concrete can also vary slightly, which means that each lamp is unique.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerfect for all kinds of spaces, it goes great with LED filament bulbs. Obviously, the light it emits will depend on the bulb we install. This allows us to fully customise the type of lighting we want for each specific environment, from the most powerful light to the most subtle, depending on the needs of each space.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe DARK\u003cstrong\u003e Rectangular concrete pendant lamp\u003c/strong\u003e has an adjustable suspension cable, which means that the height of the lamp can be adjusted to suit each person\u0027s preference and the environment in which it is to be used.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLED lighting elements such as the DARK pendant lamp allow us to create cosy spaces that bring life to every corner of the room. We can use it alone or combine several lamps at \u003cstrong\u003edifferent heights\u003c/strong\u003e, creating a visually attractive ensemble.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts unique design and solid construction make it a durable and resistant piece that can provide illumination and style for many years. The advantages of using concrete in lighting:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConcrete is a tough and durable material, which means that concrete pendant lights have a long lifespan and can withstand daily wear and tear.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConcrete has a unique texture and appearance that can add an industrial touch to the decor of a space. Concrete pendant lights for LED lighting have a unique aesthetic that can make a design statement.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConcrete pendant lights for LED lighting can be customised with different finishes, such as pigments, textures and patterns, to suit any style of décor. It is a material that allows you to easily customise it, or paint it to your liking.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e* Bulb NOT INCLUDED\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses of the Pendant Lamp - Rectangular - DARK - Concrete\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003edining rooms\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ebedrooms\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ekitchens\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eoffices\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eliving rooms\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003erestaurants\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ecafeterias\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn FactorLED we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
